        {
            "verse": 59,
            "text": [
                "Kuwani waa kuwii ka soo baxay Tel Meelaah, Tel Xarshaa, Keruub, Addoon, iyo Immer, laakiin ma ay caddayn karin in qoysaskoodu ka soo jeedaan Israa'iil:"
